  "question": {
    "text": "Coefficient of variation of two distributions are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn></math> and their arithmetic means are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math>, respectively. Difference of their standard deviation is"
